Package: mylab
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MyLab <mylab@localhost>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: podman (>= 5.4), passt, nftables, uidmap, crun, catatonit, dbus-user-session, restic, unattended-upgrades, wireguard-tools, systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/mylab/mylab
Description: Homelab management for people who aren't sysadmins
 MyLab installs and runs self-hosted services (as rootless Podman
 containers), backs them up, keeps the server updated, and connects a
 lab's servers over WireGuard, from a web UI.
